	(text "Protects external connectors and user-accessible signal lines \nagainst ESD events and transient over-voltage.\nReduces risk of damage or latch-up when cables are plugged, unplugged or mispatched."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
